cff-version: 1.2.0

title: "Statistical Analysis of Online Course Attendance"

message: >
  If you use the dataset, proposed Asymptotic Participation Proportion (APP),
  mathematical formulations, analytical methods, or source code from this
  repository, please cite this work.

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Rahman"
    given-names: "Shah Md. Tasrif"

abstract: >
  This repository presents an exploratory statistical analysis of online
course attendance, including a proposed Asymptotic Participation Proportion
(APP) for describing estimated long-run attendance. It includes supporting
mathematical formulations, a pseudonymized dataset, and analysis code.
The source code is licensed under the MIT License, while the dataset is
licensed under CC BY 4.0.

license: "MIT"

repository-code: "https://github.com/Shah-Md-Tasrif-Rahman/R_Attendance_CUSPC_SPSS_2026"

version: "1.0.0"

date-released: 2026-10-22

keywords:
  - attendance-analysis
  - asymptotic-participation-proportion
  - online-learning
  - nonlinear-regression
  - regression-analysis
  - r-programming
  - quarto
